 "description": "Inspects and automates microscopy data workflows against OMERO.server with omero-py, BlitzGateway, OMERO CLI, tables, annotations, ROIs, rendering, and documented OMERO.web APIs. Use this skill for scoped OMERO inventory, metadata export, import/export planning, or reviewed write workflows.",
 "license": "MIT",
 "compatibility": "Requires network access to a user-selected OMERO.server for remote operations. The server-tested snapshot uses OMERO.py 5.22.1 with ZeroC IcePy 3.6.5; OMERO supports Python 3.10-3.12 (3.12 recommended) while 3.13-3.14 remain upcoming in its support matrix. Bundled local planners require Python 3.10+ and read only named OMERO_* variables; they never load .env files.",
